{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Search and find the holo-robo thanks to Finder's wifi antenna, in a evolutive map drawn entirely by hand!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/radar.gif?t=1743527253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scan &amp; build new Robo using &quot;bugZZ&quot;!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/scan_and_build.gif?t=1743527253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pick your &quot;Top 3&quot; and create your &quot;Team&quot; so you can hang out with them during your journey!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/team_RC.gif?t=1743527253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More than 90 robots to find and collect, designed by comic book authors Valentin Seiche and Mortis Ghost (also creator of the game OFF), Pixel-Boy and AAA.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/Inventaire_robo.jpg?t=1743527253\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A chill and cute ballad game, for the pleasure of discovering the nooks and crannies of a district that evolves over the course of the game and expanding your Robo collection!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589460/extras/balla